      },
      "message": "feat(machines): G-EDM Wire EDM (template) machine file\n\nassets/machines/g-edm.mch: a wire_edm with X and Y, a guides head,\nedm.awt false and controller.post \"G-EDM Wire EDM\". It states no\ntravel, rapid, guide height, taper, wire diameter, edm.codes or\ncondition: each G-EDM build is different, and the unstated-limits law\nforbids a guess. With no condition the Wire Contour door (#531) refuses\nthe cut by the condition's name; with a measured condition it posts.\nRegistered in MACHINES and embedded(); the site machine table and the\npost guide name it.\n\nFixes #2701\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
